sequenceDiagram
  title Analysis sequence diagram - UC-02 Ask a Question About Course Materials (main scenario)
  actor S as Student
  participant QH as QuestionHandler
  participant PF as PassageFinder
  participant LR as Local LLM runtime (external)
  participant A as Answer
  S->>+QH: 3 submits a question (question text)
  QH->>+PF: 4a asks for the passages in the course most relevant to the question
  PF-->>-QH: relevant passages
  QH->>QH: 4b checks that at least one passage is relevant
  QH->>+LR: 4c asks for an answer built only from those passages
  LR-->>-QH: generated text
  QH->>A: 4d records the answer with a citation for each passage used
  QH->>-S: 4e shows the answer with its citations
